# Claude Code plugin-managed skill bundles — general-purpose tooling, not
# datadave.dev content. Managed by the plugin/marketplace system, so a
# committed copy would just go stale. Project-specific skills/agents/settings
# under .claude/ (settings.json, agents/, skills/pre-launch-check,
# skills/write-post) are intentionally NOT ignored and stay tracked.
.claude/skills/banner-design/
.claude/skills/brand/
.claude/skills/design/
.claude/skills/design-system/
.claude/skills/slides/
.claude/skills/ui-styling/
.claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/
